#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/BallToss/BallToss.uexp
msgctxt "::A1025AF34A9FCBB4F1323F9C216CBCC0"
msgid ""
"The Baron’s Birde Feeding Etiquette. Chapter 3.\\n\\nMy, my. Thou hast made "
"it far in my little instructory folio. Take heed in understanding that "
"whosoever attempts to feed the birdes must perform that act with the utmost "
"care and coordination. Shouldst thou fail, the battle against the dreaded "
"dragon Cornelius shan’t end in our favor.\\n\\nThus, use thy mouse to aim "
"thy birdseede with grace. It is an excellent opportunity to aim at the large"
" Birb statue when the birdes lift the basket. The more thou hast fed them, "
"the greater the birdly celebration will be."
msgstr ""

