msgctxt "::7AA7BD784C088267E2349D96C62BB2C5"
msgid ""
"You’ve arrived in the depths of a sparkling ice cave. This grants you the "
"opportunity to engage in an intriguing event.\\n\\nBounce the balls off the "
"bounce pad and light as many tiles as you can. The more tiles you light, the"
" more points you earn. Light up all the tiles to enter the bonus round. "
"During the bonus round, every tile will give you extra points, so start "
"throwing like there’s no tomorrow. There may not be."
