#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/DragonsTreasure/DragonsTreasure.uexp
msgctxt "::352AF8624E115D2B8F23A29EE86AC898"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, a dragon has some treasure. Sometimes, that treasure should be "
"shared. Mostly because the dragon probably stole it from you in the first "
"place.\\n\\nLuckily, Gerald the dragon doesn’t mind - So long as you can get"
" the coins through his maze of tricks. \\n\\nLight up all 6 of the dragon's "
"precious gems and the wheel of treasure will spin. If you wake the dragon, "
"Gerald will add more to your push for treasure!"
msgstr ""

