msgid ""
"If you’re reading this, there is hope. \\n\\nThis machine is dedicated to "
"someone special. In his time, he found use of this arcade cabinet in the "
"fight against [REDACTED]. Perhaps playing it in your time will give you a "
"shot when the fight begins.\\n\\nTest your shooting skills in this quick "
"draw game. There are 4 rounds with different targets for each round. Holster"
