#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SalmonSays/SalmonSays.uexp
msgctxt "::2CBB7D7F4344071B6281D88EF701ABFC"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the majestic river, home of all aquatic life. Even in this land "
"of plenty, there is still one who rules over all. You must obey the salmon "
"wizard and DO AS IT SAYS! It does not take fools under its fin. Failing it "
"will destroy your sacred connection to the ecosystem.\\n\\nFirst, watch the "
"salmon wizard light the buttons up. Then, press the buttons yourself, "
"repeating their exact same sequence. Each time you successfully finish a "
"sequence, a new button will light up and add to the sequence. You must "
"repeat the sequence from the very beginning and continue doing so for as "
"long as you can. After reaching 5 button presses in a single sequence, you "
"will start to earn tickets."
msgstr ""

