msgid ""
"Filter which MIDI channels the instrument should listen to for playback, to "
"manage many MIDI input channels with the same MIDI input device at the same "
"time. Click on channels in the grid above to select a channel for filtering."
" Filtered channels have red italic text. \"Off\" disables the filter list, "
"\"block\" will block all specified channels, and \"allow\" will only let "
"through the specified channels."
